# BuildKit only honours a .dockerignore next to the Dockerfile when it is named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore; this file is kept identical to Dockerfile.dockerignore for tools that look for the plain name (a test enforces this).
# Keep host artefacts out of the build context: the image builds everything itself from source.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
/docs/secret
/_site
/coverage
plc-st-test-results
**/plc-st-test-results
.claude
